@archive 0160
@size 61

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SatellaPoliceWizard
	"크림슨 머신의\n꼭대기에 동력 코어가 있어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"사이버 코어로 전파\n변환해서 제어판을\n파괴해!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SatellaPoliceWizard
	"시스템이 언제\n가동될지 몰라… 지금\n당장 움직여야 해!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SatellaPoliceWizard
	"부대원들의 위저드를 모아서"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"록맨 지원 부대를\n편성했어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"네가 크림슨 머신의\n동력 코어를 파괴하는 동안"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"우리가 가동 중인 실드 시스템을\n제압할게!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"안타깝게도 노이즈가 심한\n환경에서는 우리의\n능력이 크게 떨어져…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그냥 웨이브 인하는 것만으로도\n자살행위야… 전파 변환은 말할 것도\n없고."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SatellaPoliceWizard
	"가동 중인 실드 시스템의\n요격 공격은 우리가\n막아 줄게!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 4 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SatellaPoliceWizard
	"네가 웨이브 인해서\n동력 코어로 가!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
